From 91f431168b1ebd9c5fb83a28e63391543ffad7a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duke Jones <104690+dukejones@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:36:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add the ingest keyframe gate on the vendored pin.

Policy stays off unless whip::Request enables it. When on, startup, step, period, loss, and join share one floor and one PLI. Viewer keyframe requests stay logged and dropped.
